BT 1 0 0 1 28 286 Tm (The Riverview-Mill strategy is intentionally organized as a network rather than a collection of isolated projects. Safer crossings, a redesigned Maple Avenue, the Foundry Greenway, improved transit) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 28 274.9 Tm (access and stronger park connections each solve a different part of the same trip. Their value increases when implemented together.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 9.72 TL ET
.141176 .211765 .239216 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 28 258.8 Tm (The plan also demonstrates an implementation approach that can move from near-term safety work to larger capital investments without losing the overall vision. Quick-build crossings, design studies,) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 28 247.7 Tm (service coordination and maintenance agreements can begin early while the City advances feasibility, engineering and funding for complete-street and greenway projects.) Tj T* ET
BT /F1 8.1 Tf 9.72 TL ET
.141176 .211765 .239216 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 28 231.6 Tm (The central measure of success is practical: residents should be able to leave home, move safely through the neighborhood, reach transit or a low-stress bicycle route, arrive at work or a park reliably,) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 28 220.5 Tm (and return after dark with confidence. By closing the gaps that interrupt that trip, Lakehaven can turn transportation from a barrier into a platform for access, health, neighborhood vitality and economic) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 28 209.4 Tm (opportunity.) Tj T* ET
